### health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### создать
POST http://localhost:8000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{"brand": "Toyota", "model": "Camry", "price_per_day": 5000, "available": true}

### список
GET http://localhost:8000/api/cars

### список с пагинацией
GET http://localhost:8000/api/cars?limit=2&offset=0

### список с фильтром
GET http://localhost:8000/api/cars?brand=Toyota

### получить по id
GET http://localhost:8000/api/cars/1

### обновить
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"price_per_day": 4500}

### удалить
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/cars/1

### снова получить (404)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/cars/1

### битый JSON (400)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{"brand": "Toyota",

### пустое обязательное поле (400)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{"brand": "", "model": "Camry", "price_per_day": 5000}